@* LatihanSoal logo (BRD-10, D-118; replaces the exam-sheet column of D-100): a stack of books that becomes a pillar,
   because practice is the pillar of success. The capital is an open book, the shaft four books seen from the spine
   (ink and the wordmark's sky blue in turn, slightly uneven like a real stack), and the base two wide slabs. Ink parts
   use currentColor and the open pages var(--surface), so the mark flips in dark mode while the blue books stay blue.
   The wordmark stacks LATIHAN over a light blue SOAL. favicon.svg and favicon.ico use the same mark on a white tile. *@
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" data-testid="logo">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 48 56" class="h-10 w-[2.15rem] shrink-0 text-slate-900" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round">
    <path d="M24 8.5C19.5 5.5 13 5 6.5 6.2V13.6C13 12.4 19.5 12.9 24 15.9z" fill="var(--surface)" />
    <path d="M24 8.5C28.5 5.5 35 5 41.5 6.2V13.6C35 12.4 28.5 12.9 24 15.9z" fill="var(--surface)" />
    <path d="M24 8.5v7.4" />
    <path d="M10.5 9.5c3.5-.5 7-.2 10 1.2M37.5 9.5c-3.5-.5-7-.2-10 1.2" stroke-width="1.4" />
    <g stroke="none">
      <rect x="14.5" y="17.2" width="19" height="6.2" rx="1.2" fill="currentColor" />
      <rect x="13.5" y="24.2" width="21" height="6.2" rx="1.2" fill="#1d9bf0" />
      <rect x="15" y="31.2" width="18.5" height="6.2" rx="1.2" fill="currentColor" />
      <rect x="14" y="38.2" width="20" height="6.2" rx="1.2" fill="#1d9bf0" />
      <rect x="9" y="45.2" width="30" height="3.6" rx="1" fill="currentColor" />
      <rect x="6" y="49.6" width="36" height="3.6" rx="1" fill="currentColor" />
    </g>
    @* Spine details: bands on the ink books, a label on the blue ones. *@
    <g stroke="var(--surface)" stroke-width="1.3">
      <path d="M18 19.1v2.4M30 19.1v2.4" />
      <path d="M20 27.3h8" />
      <path d="M18.5 33.1v2.4M30 33.1v2.4" />
      <path d="M20 41.3h8" />
    </g>
  </svg>
  <span class="flex flex-col text-base leading-none font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">
    <span class="text-slate-900">Latihan</span>
    <span class="text-[#1d9bf0]">Soal</span>
  </span>
</span>
